=2 Walkthrough
* **{c=red:Note:}** **This quest is only offered to one player per Vana'diel Day, per World.**
* Speak to {n:Zauko} in {z:Lower Jeuno} at (I-6) between 18:03 and 21:00.
* You must light all of the **Streetlamps** in {z:Lower Jeuno} before 01:00.
** To light one, simply run up to it and interact with it.
** There are 12 total that must be lit.
** You only need to light all 12 before 1:00. You can return to {n:Zauko} after that for credit.
* Repeating this quest a second time grants the {k:Lamp lighter's membership card}. This item functions similar to the {k:Marble Bridge coaster}. You receive a notification when you zone into {z:Lower Jeuno} if {n:Zauko} is looking for assistance.

If nobody accepts {n:Zauko}'s quest before 1:00 game time, {n:Vhana Ehgaklywha} can be seen lighting the streetlamps.
